cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use IVAR, or build on its design, please cite it as below."
title: "IVAR: Intent Verified Adaptive Response"
abstract: >-
  Intent bound defence against agentic intrusion: a trust graph of
  identities, workloads and data, eight detection methods, a safeguarded
  response ladder, intent binding for irreversible actions, and a hash
  chained evidence store that makes every verdict replayable.
